2. `_override_finalize_out`:
```python
@sph_harm_y._override_finalize_out
def _(out):
    if (out.shape[-1] == 1):
        return out[..., 0, 0]

    if (out.shape[-1] == 2):
        return out[..., 0, 0], out[..., [1, 0], [0, 1]]

    if (out.shape[-1] == 3):
        return (out[..., 0, 0], out[..., [1, 0], [0, 1]],
            out[..., [[2, 1], [1, 0]], [[0, 1], [1, 2]]])
